# Private plugins never reach the public repo: everything in here is ignored
# except the workspace plumbing, the docs and the example-* plugins.
# Keep yours in your own repo and mirror them in with HEXCRAWL_PLUGINS_DIR
# (see AGENTS.md) — an ignored folder that exists only in one checkout is
# exactly the kind of work that gets lost.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/package.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/vitest.config.ts
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/example-*/
